msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Тени..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_A3A944E3_E25A_4214_A1DE_241FE8A2A076
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb1a268d05446ba7e09e4c8c20902ccc269f887b74fb836839f38bfa4a60bde0
